<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Deepwoken tapdancer talent autoroll</Major>
    <Description>Hello! i've decided to make this macro to basically make it easier to roll in deepwoken (pressing Q then right click to feint your roll)

This basically does it for you very fast and multiple times, so you can dodge alot of attacks at once (preferably have the Ghost talent aswell)

This is very op, and gives you huge boost!

(this is not bannable ingame, so don't worry)

Q to roll, and right click to feint mid animation (NEED TO HAVE TAPDANCER TALENT WHICH REQUIRES 65AGILITY)

I will be making more macro's for deepwoken!
Enjoy :)</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
